7. **Major — GOAL coverage still lacks complete ownership and acceptance mapping.**  
   [PLAN.md:109](/home/zyk/projects/interests/ai-video/qwen/qsa-hisparse-plugin/docs/PLAN.md:109), [PLAN.md:129](/home/zyk/projects/interests/ai-video/qwen/qsa-hisparse-plugin/docs/PLAN.md:129).

