8. **Minor — binding uniqueness counts references and misses bindings.**  
   [fingerprint.py:36](/home/zyk/projects/interests/ai-video/qwen/qsa-hisparse-plugin/src/sglang_qsa_hisparse/fingerprint.py:36).

