     2	
     3	Patch modules live in ``patches/model_compat/`` and ``patches/hisparse/`` and
     4	are discovered automatically, so parallel work adds files instead of editing
     5	a shared list. A module declares hooks with ``@patch(...)`` and new members
     6	with ``@attach(...)`` at import time, each tagged with its inventory row;
     7	modules are imported only when their feature is active.
